# key: grading.errors.scale_fixed
#: ninefruits/grading/actions/save_grade_scale.py
msgid "The grade scale is fixed at installation and cannot change."
msgstr "ມາດຕາເກຣດຖືກກຳນົດຕາຍຕົວຕອນຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້."

# key: grading.help.scale_fixed
#: ninefruits/grading/admin.py
msgid "The grade scale is fixed at installation: grades and GPAs are on it. It cannot be moved to another scale."
msgstr "ມາດຕາເກຣດຖືກກຳນົດຕາຍຕົວຕອນຕິດຕັ້ງ: ເກຣດ ແລະ GPA ອີງຕາມມັນ. ບໍ່ສາມາດຍ້າຍໄປມາດຕາອື່ນໄດ້."

